---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { PRIJSNOTA, PRIJZEN, TEKST, prijsband } from "../../config";

const titel = "ISO 27001 gap scan and security questionnaire";
const beschrijving =
  "ISO 27001 gap analysis for a SaaS, IT or MSP firm. Includes preparing a security questionnaire when that is the trigger. Indicative band, not market-tested.";
const scan = prijsband(PRIJZEN.gapScan, "en");
const audit = prijsband(PRIJZEN.interneAudit, "en");
const avg = prijsband(PRIJZEN.avg, "en");
const implementatie = prijsband(PRIJZEN.implementatie, "en");
const retainer = prijsband(PRIJZEN.retainerMaand, "en");
---

<Base titel={titel} beschrijving={beschrijving} taal="en" lees>
  <h1>{titel}</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    The entry offer is an ISO 27001 gap analysis, or preparing a security
    questionnaire, when a customer asks for it.
  </p>

  <h2>Who and when</h2>
  <p>
    For a Dutch SaaS firm, IT provider or MSP. The trigger is a customer's
    date or a tender: ISO 27001, or completing a security questionnaire.
  </p>

  <h2>Contents</h2>
  <p>
    Document review, interviews, and a gap register. If the trigger is a
    security questionnaire, a prepared or completed list, as far as the
    documents allow.
  </p>

  <h2>Indicative band</h2>
  <p>
    Gap scan or questionnaire scan: {scan} excl. VAT. {PRIJSNOTA.en}
  </p>

  <h2>What can follow</h2>
  <p>
    A next step can be to outsource the ISO 27001 internal audit: an
    independent internal audit (not a certification audit), indicative {audit}
    excl. VAT. {PRIJSNOTA.en} That is context, not a second button.
  </p>
  <p>
    An AVG baseline on the same system is one further piece of work,
    indicative {avg} excl. VAT. {PRIJSNOTA.en} There is no separate page for it.
  </p>
  <p>
    Support with ISO 27001 implementation sits indicatively at {implementatie}
    excl. VAT. {PRIJSNOTA.en} That is also context, not a menu.
  </p>
  <p>
    A retainer for follow-up sits indicatively at {retainer} per month excl.
    VAT. {PRIJSNOTA.en}
  </p>

  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>
    I never certify my own work. The person who implements is never the
    internal auditor for the same client. I do not issue a certificate.
    Accredited certification bodies do that. I do not judge the statute and I
    do not issue an accountant's report.
  </p>

  <p><a class="knop" href="/en/contact/">{TEKST.en.cta}</a></p>
</Base>
